        <span class="pcard-stack">TypeScript, Next.js, PostgreSQL, pgvector</span>
        <p>I wanted an AI agent that could handle my LMS for me. Nine typed tools, persistent memory, a planner that knows what's due before I ask. The judges at HackRamapo responded to the architecture and documentation more than anything.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pcard fade-up">
        <h3>Center for Food Action</h3>
        <span class="pcard-stack">Python, Flask, PostgreSQL</span>
        <p>Volunteers log donated food one-handed while carrying boxes. I built a barcode-scanning inventory system designed for that reality. Serving 40,000 people across six pantries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pcard fade-up">
        <h3>EmotionFlix</h3>
        <span class="pcard-stack">React, TypeScript, Node.js, PostgreSQL</span>
        <p>Movie recommendations don't account for how you feel. This system scans your face on-device, maps emotions to genres, and adapts over time. 69 tests. No data leaves the browser.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pcard fade-up">
